Description: AirDrop-compatible UCanDrop client and native radio backend
 UCanDrop provides a user-facing command, an unprivileged AirDrop receiver,
 and a source-built OWL radio backend for supported Ubuntu 26.04 systems.
 Receiving is off after installation. The package installs no enabled service
 and leaves setup and receive-window activation to the normal desktop user.
 Hardware support is capability-probed; installation does not promise support
 for every Wi-Fi adapter.
